# General Settings
option.SPECULAR_INTENSITY=Specular Intensity
option.SPECULAR_INTENSITY.comment=Adjusts the strength of the specular highlights.

# Lighting Settings
option.GAMMA=Gamma
option.GAMMA.comment=Gamma correction for tone mapping. Lower values = brighter, higher values = darker.

option.AMBIENT_FACTOR=Ambient Factor
option.AMBIENT_FACTOR.comment=Base ambient lighting level. Higher values = brighter shadows.

option.SUN_INTENSITY=Sun Intensity
option.SUN_INTENSITY.comment=Multiplier for direct sunlight brightness.
option.HDR_EXPOSURE=HDR Exposure
option.HDR_EXPOSURE.comment=Linear exposure applied before denoise and upscaling.
option.COLOR_SATURATION=Color Saturation
option.COLOR_SATURATION.comment=Linear color saturation before final reconstruction.
option.COLOR_CONTRAST=Color Contrast
option.COLOR_CONTRAST.comment=Linear contrast around middle gray.

option.INDIRECT_SCALE=Indirect Scale
option.INDIRECT_SCALE.comment=Controls the intensity of bounced light (global illumination). When light hits a surface and bounces off to illuminate other surfaces, this slider controls how bright those secondary bounces are. Higher values = more vibrant indirect lighting, lower values = darker shadows and less color bleeding.

option.MIN_LIGHTING=Minimum Lighting
option.MIN_LIGHTING.comment=Sets the base ambient lighting level (0.0 to 0.5).

# Screen Menus
screen.LIGHTING_SETTINGS=Lighting Settings
screen.LIGHTING_SETTINGS.comment=Adjust lighting parameters like gamma, ambient, and sun intensity.

screen.MATERIALS_SETTINGS=Material Settings
screen.MATERIALS_SETTINGS.comment=Adjust material properties.

screen.EMISSION_SETTINGS=Block Emission
screen.EMISSION_SETTINGS.comment=Controls emissive surfaces and stable blocklight appearance.
screen.VOLUMETRIC_SETTINGS=Volumetrics
screen.VOLUMETRIC_SETTINGS.comment=Controls shadowed atmospheric scattering.
screen.SHADOW_SETTINGS=Soft Shadows
screen.ADVANCED_RT_SETTINGS=Advanced RT
screen.WATER_GLASS_SETTINGS=Water & Glass
screen.WATER_GLASS_SETTINGS.comment=Controls animated water normals, water clarity, glass transmission, and crystal lighting.
screen.SKY_FOLIAGE_SETTINGS=Sky & Foliage
screen.SKY_FOLIAGE_SETTINGS.comment=Controls procedural sky detail and normal-only foliage wind.

option.EMISSIVE_SURFACE_INTENSITY=Emitter Surface Intensity
option.BAREBONES_GBUFFER_ALBEDO=Barebones G-buffer Albedo
option.BAREBONES_GBUFFER_ALBEDO.comment=Removes vanilla vertex brightness from albedo while keeping tint hue; Vulkanite owns lighting.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_TABLE_ENABLE=Section Light Table
option.SECTION_LIGHT_TABLE_ENABLE.comment=Exposes the uploaded per-section emitter table for prototype directional blocklight and debug comparisons.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SAMPLE_LIMIT=Section Light Sample Limit
option.SECTION_LIGHT_TABLE_FALLBACK_ENABLE=Table Lighting Fallback
option.SECTION_LIGHT_TABLE_FALLBACK_ENABLE.comment=Experimental unoccluded binding 22 final-light fallback. Keep off when judging leakage.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_DEBUG_MODE=Section Probe Debug
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_DEBUG_MODE.comment=Overrides final lighting with binding 23 diagnostics. Radiance shows the strongest normal-facing face color with compressed brightness; Dominant Face shows the stored probe axis before surface-normal weighting; Confidence shows the packed per-face visibility term; Source Markers show uploaded binding 22 light positions for cache/source alignment; Leak Check is heuristic false-color against rough table/lightmap references, not table truth: magenta=missing page, yellow=probe-only, blue/cyan=under-lit, red=suspected leak/over-bright, green=matched-ish.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_ISOTROPIC_FILL=Probe Diffuse Fill
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_ISOTROPIC_FILL.comment=Adds a tiny low-frequency fill from average probe radiance. Keep near zero; high values can draw fake source halos and page-shaped outlines.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_CONFIDENCE_FLOOR=Probe Confidence Floor
option.SECTION_LIGHT_PROBE_CONFIDENCE_FLOOR.comment=Minimum effective visibility confidence for nonzero probe faces. Keep near zero to avoid leaking low-confidence source radiance.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SPARSE_RT_CORRECTION=Sparse Probe RT Correction
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SPARSE_RT_CORRECTION.comment=Uses a tiny ray-query budget to validate low-confidence bright probe samples before they leak through blockers.
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SPARSE_RT_SAMPLES=Sparse Probe RT Samples
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SPARSE_RT_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=Sparse RT Confidence Threshold
option.SECTION_LIGHT_SPARSE_RT_LEAK_LUMA=Sparse RT Leak Luma
